OL,3,GNEWSAEssex has the 'perfect
OL,4,Ainfrastructure' for immigration crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FI am in the back of an unmarked police
OL,7,Fcar, being driven around Southend by an
OL,8,Fofficer who regularly makes more
OL,9,Farrests than anyone else in the force.
OL,11,FPC Paul Simmons is a road traffic
OL,12,Fofficer with the power to stop any
OL,13,Fvehicle.
OL,15,FSuch road policing powers have helped
OL,16,FEssex Police and forces across England
OL,17,Fcarry out a two-week "intensification"
OL,18,Fon organised immigration crime.
